WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.330
<i>Having won the Raten Taishou,</i>

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:16.010
<i>Chou Soran was attempting to learn the 
way of the Tenshi, mark of the next Tenshi.</i>

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:19.820
Eizan, keep a close watch on Shinchuu.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.080
Of course, Master.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.870
<i>As this was happening, the Tenshifu was 
attacked by enemy organization Zensei.</i>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:45.170
<i>Predicting a Zensei attack, Jo San and 
Jo Yon of the Express Delivery Company,</i>

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>as well as Rikukin and the outsiders 
he gathered, fought alongside</i>

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:55.850
<i>the monks of the Tenshifu in the fierce 
battle unfolding on Ryuukosan.</i>

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:56.860
What?

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.790
Rikukin-senpai, you must know...

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.910
What makes the Zensei's Four 
Sorcerers so terrifying

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.770
is their ability to crush a person's spirit.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:14.480
<i>During the battle, Rikukin fell 
into a trap and went on a rampage</i>

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.350
<i>when he was overwhelmed by his own evil ki.</i>

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:21.810
<i>However, mortal combat against the Tenshi</i>

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.650
<i>released him from its grasp and 
brought him to his senses.</i>

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:26.730
Huh?

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:31.050
You can't kill me.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.140
If you're alive, you should've said so!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:40.460
<i>Meanwhile, Fuu Houhou was also 
able to escape a tough situation,</i>

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:44.480
<i>after being lured out by enemies, 
and was safely reunited with Chou Soran.</i>

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.910
Chou Soran, Chou Soran, Chou Soran...

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.960
I'll tell you all about what happened 
with the Tenshi when we get home.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.490
<i>Through their efforts, 
Zensei was driven back.</i>

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.590
<i>However...</i>

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.640
<i>More than a few were injured 
or worse in the battle.</i>

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.490
<i>The months that pass within my dreams</i>

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:23.410
<i>I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair</i>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:29.670
<i>If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes</i>

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.130
<i>In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world</i>

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.010
<i>Shangri-la is nowhere to be found</i>

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:44.810
<i>No one knows the love of the spring wind</i>

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:54.020
<i>The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over</i>

00:02:54.610 --> 00:03:01.990
<i>Trading places, they bloom then wilt</i>

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.830
<i>In January, I pick a flower with no petals</i>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:13.170
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>In March, the peach blossoms bloom</i>

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:24.640
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.680
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:32.770
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:42.740
<b>22:                Master</b>

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:59.550
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.920
What happened?

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.040
They're still alive.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.020
They're alive, but...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.430
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.310
Ryoutenshaku!

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:23.330
You're lucky you didn't go 
after En-san or Kan Tan.

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:26.820
I'm a simple mourner.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:32.580
I'm not nearly as strong 
as geniuses like them.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.520
En Tou, you liar!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.970
You said they were all young weaklings!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.130
Shut up!

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:54.010
Quit crying and focus on the fight!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.680
Poor me!

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:04.320
Since I'm so pathetic, 
let me get a free hit in!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.700
Bring it on!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.240
Shoushou?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.210
Stay back!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.030
I can handle him by my—

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.280
What was that for?

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.710
You idiot, calm down.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:26.960
You don't seem aware of it, 
but he's changing you.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.140
What?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.890
You're losing focus. He's distracting you.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:36.970
Normally, you wouldn't speak to your 
opponent so much during a fight.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.760
He's not crying because he's scared.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.950
He's crying to draw your soul in.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:50.760
Why am I so unlucky?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:55.670
It was so close to working!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.080
Be careful.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:01.500
Now that we know what he's doing, he'll 
probably do whatever it takes to beat us.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.580
We should retreat.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.290
Something's wrong with Mare.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.700
Retreat?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.370
Does that mean you know how to fix Mare?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.420
Well...

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:20.150
Not only did we fail to capture him 
three on one, but he got one of us.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.620
We can't back down now.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.170
We should strike while the iron is hot.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:30.550
It should take some time for 
him to draw in all our souls.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.580
We'll capture him alive and restore Mare.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.560
It's a risk we'll have to take.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.330
You're right.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.850
I'll attack from the front.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.810
Back me up with your shinki.

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:46.190
Watch out for his weird staff.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.150
Stay away!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.970
Two on one? How cruel!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.910
It's over.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.920
It hurts!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.320
How long are you going to keep crying?

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:28.370
But I'm so unlucky. Nobody loves me.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.420
Why won't anyone come save me?

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:34.530
Look at what I've been through!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.960
You're not making any sense.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.660
Damn!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.720
Mare? Have you lost your mind?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.380
What are you doing?

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.350
Stop, Mare!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:57.960
Snap out of it!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.350
Masked man...

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:11.920
No matter how much I cry, 
I can't seem to draw in your soul.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:19.720
The only ones who take pity on my cries are 
the dead I mourn with this ragged pennant.

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:23.780
And those who touch this pennant 
are afflicted by the ki of the dead.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:30.560
My cries have made that shrimp's soul weak.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:33.760
The ki of the dead flows through his body.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:37.170
He's their puppet now.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.260
Mare, stop!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:42.590
Don't!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.890
You bastard...

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.060
You're going to chase me?

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:01.060
But you don't have time for that now.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.430
Shouldn't you be helping your friends?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.990
Without help, they'll both die.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.360
It's my fault this happened to them.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.990
It's all my fault...

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:47.930
Jo Yon-san.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.370
Well, if it isn't Tou Raku-san.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:59.860
You did well to capture 
so many Zensei members.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:04.370
I don't deserve your praise.
We suffered a lot of damage, too.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:08.110
I'm just grateful HQ won't be punishing us.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:13.190
Our branch was responsible 
for security this time.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:20.420
I'm truly grateful you decided 
to take the lead regardless.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.910
Don't worry.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.560
We'll handle the aftermath.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.320
By the way, have you heard?

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:38.580
HQ is summoning the leadership 
of the six major districts.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.860
A summons from HQ?

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.710
Did something happen?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.540
Kanan District's Ryou-san was killed.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.740
Ryou-san was?

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:55.030
HQ hasn't publicly released 
the information yet.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:58.020
Only a few people in 
leadership positions know.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:03.530
It seems he was killed by 
one of his part-timers.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:09.940
The leaders of the various districts were 
probably summoned because of the incident.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:16.330
The Express Delivery Company's part-time 
system might be discontinued.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.850
You should prepare yourself 
for the possibility.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.610
What about you?

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.370
Don't you have part-timers?

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:28.300
We have no choice but 
to obey HQ's decisions.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.070
I don't like it.

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:33.060
Getting rid of part-timers?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:37.580
Without them, we can't run our businesses.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:48.960
When your father first hired a 
part-timer, people doubted his sanity.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:54.640
But he shut them up by doing 
better than expected.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:12:01.460
It's the reason the Express Delivery 
Company continues to employ part-timers.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:06.320
I still respect your father.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:10.780
He could've taken a 
management position at HQ,

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:14.130
but he continued to risk his 
life on the front lines.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:17.520
It's true that with part-timers,

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:22.140
we're able to easily complete difficult 
jobs we couldn't handle on our own.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:27.160
But if HQ's determined to 
revise the part-time system,

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.720
there's nothing we can do about it.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:36.770
You're right. I'm not strong 
enough to oppose HQ on my own.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.640
Why don't we grab a bite 
together, Tou Raku-san?

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.900
Let's.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:49.610
We don't often get opportunities to meet 
with leaders from other districts.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.980
They're going to be okay, right?

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:03.070
What happened?

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:07.220
Hana-chan's badly injured, 
but this is awful...

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.910
You kids...

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.520
Was anyone else injured?

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.510
No, we're fine.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.430
I see. I'm glad you're all right.

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.500
Rikukin-sama.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:26.060
We'll take Mare and Shoushou to the 
Express Delivery Company's infirmary.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.320
Our medical team is skilled.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.610
They're used to this kind of thing.

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:33.710
Don't worry.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.000
Can I go with them?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.860
Yes, of course.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.280
Show Rikukin-sama to the infirmary.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:42.970
Yes, sir.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.720
Thank you, Jo San.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.590
This way, Rikukin-sama.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.430
That settles things for now.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:01.520
T-Tenshi?

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.220
Tenshi, what happened to you?

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.020
Don't worry about me.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.910
Anyway, what happened to the 
Zensei attacking the mountain?

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:15.600
They've been brought under control, but...

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.570
I'm sorry.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:21.880
Our lack of preparation resulted in 
casualties among the Tenshifu's monks.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:25.490
It's not your fault.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.570
We keep ourselves cooped 
up on this mountain.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:32.370
It's good to get some 
exercise once in a while.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.130
I came here because
I wanted to speak with you.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:45.620
Come with me, Soran.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.220
I've got a lot of aftermath 
to deal with, too.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.520
Let's keep this brief.

00:14:58.590 --> 00:14:59.640
Soran.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:05.500
Will you or won't you become the Tenshi?

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:07.170
Which is it?

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:09.800
Master...

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:15.350
Master, you still haven't 
answered my question.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.840
Once you do, I'll answer yours.

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.470
My answer, huh?

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:27.430
You should already know what it is.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:34.940
Master...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.850
Can I continue to call you master?

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:48.500
I did a lot to influence the Raten Taishou,

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.000
but it seems it was all for naught.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.310
Stand, Soran.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:04.610
As long as you do no evil, 
I will always be your master.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:09.400
And Ryuukosan is your home.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.990
Master, I...

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:15.360
Don't speak.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:20.810
If you understand that, then 
you must understand my pain.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:25.040
What happens next is up to you.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:30.130
The Express Delivery Company considers 
you a person of great importance.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:36.720
With them protecting you,
I doubt anyone will attack you.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:42.880
But if anything does happen, 
come see your master.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:44.370
I will.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.070
He's here.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.170
You finally came...

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.670
Master of Zensei.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:24.190
Old Man Ryuusei, how did it go?

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:28.040
The girl was Baron's equal.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:32.810
An old man like me couldn't 
capture her alive.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:39.510
And Baron abandoned us and disappeared.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.490
I see. That's too bad.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:44.080
En-san, how about you?

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.340
I did what you asked.

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:51.390
How about you?

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:57.890
They were young weaklings, 
but we suffered a lot of casualties.

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:04.720
If you've returned empty-handed, 
then as promised, your life is forfeit.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.740
Stop!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:11.240
Don't crush it!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:18.320
What are you doing here, Eizan?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.420
Would you believe it, Master?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:28.150
He disguised himself as a 
Ryuukosan monk and attacked me.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.730
I know the faces of all the other monks.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.470
He can't fool me.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:37.440
I asked you why you're here.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:41.540
I thought I ordered you 
to protect Den Shinchuu.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:45.680
Well, Shinchuu-sama told me to...

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.800
Don't worry, Master.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:52.400
Shinchuu-sama said he'd be fine.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:53.730
You fool!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.760
We're going to Shinchuu!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:03.070
But Master, there really isn't anyone here.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:08.990
Not even members of the Tenshifu 
come this deep into the mountain.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:12.580
Shinchuu has no means to protect himself.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:15.710
If anything happens to him...

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.440
Don't worry. You're overthinking it, Master.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.670
I'm back, Shinchuu-sama.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.210
Shinchuu-sama?

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.710
Shinchuu-sama?

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.960
Kei-chan, Hane-chan?

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.720
The master has arrived.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:41.790
It's fine.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.940
See? Shinchuu-sama's right in...

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.490
The plan worked.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:11.620
As planned, I was able to 
acquire the information.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:13.270
Don't worry.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.530
I killed Den Shinchuu.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:19.680
Grandmaster Den!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.010
Grandmaster Eizan!

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.270
It's an emergency!

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.130
What's wrong, Hane-chan?

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.440
The Tenshifu...

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.880
The Tenshifu is being attacked by Zensei!

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:32.250
Those fiends! What are they after?

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.220
That's not all!

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:36.780
The Tenshi got caught up in the fighting!

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:37.750
What?

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.650
There's too many of them...

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.870
At this rate, everyone will die!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:45.160
Damn! What should we do?

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.850
Go, Eizan.

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.870
Save your brothers.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.050
But protecting you is...

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:55.500
They won't come this far into the mountain!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.450
Now go! That's an order!

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.210
Understood.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:05.740
Hane-chan, Kei-chan. 
Look after Shinchuu-sama.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.490
You can count on us, Master.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:12.710
They can beat Zensei, right?

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.180
The Tenshifu won't be destroyed, will it?

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.010
It's okay.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.990
They're not after the Tenshifu.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:24.180
Hane, how do you know that?

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:28.300
There's no telling what Zensei will do.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:33.230
Hane, you...

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:35.350
I know that.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:38.720
That's why I insisted:

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.250
if they had to destroy something, 
destroy buildings that don't matter.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:48.690
After living here for three 
years, it's grown on me.

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.380
Let me introduce myself.

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:54.490
I'm the acting Master of Zensei...

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:57.050
Kyoukei.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:03.090
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:07.050
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:11.140
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:15.060
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:19.190
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.280
<i>Cute, cute girl</i>

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:27.150
<i>She has such a calm face</i>

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:31.080
<i>But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next</i>

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:34.660
<i>And fills them with holes</i>

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.920
<i>I don’t know where she came from</i>

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you</i>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.880
<i>She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying</i>

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.680
<i>She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid</i>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:54.810
<i>Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine</i>

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:58.770
<i>This dignified girl is never scared</i>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:02.860
<i>She works hard all night burying</i>

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:07.030
<i>She buries others in order to survive</i>

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:11.280
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:15.160
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:19.040
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.130
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:25.880
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...</i>

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:28.220
<i>I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!</i>

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:30.180
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:32.380
I'm Hane-chan, or Kyoukei, 
the Master of Zensei.

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.930
Soran and Houhou won't be 
in the next episode, either.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:36.220
Isn't that exciting?

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:38.300
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Repose."

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>23:                      Repose</b>

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:39.460
Don't miss it.
